  "published": "2026-10-02T22:03:12.573Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "False-positive and accuracy fixes across 14 rules. LC022 stays quiet on nested ToList/ToArray/ToHashSet on EF Core 8+ and reports ToDictionary as untranslatable. LC001, LC006, LC007, LC009, LC010, LC021, LC023, LC031, LC040, LC061, LC062 and LC063 stay quiet on code shapes found to be safe in real apps (load-once guards, factory-created contexts, split queries applied downstream, row-limited FromSql roots, query filters configured out of sight and more). LC059 now reports connection?.Dispose() on the context's connection, and LC060 follows interface-typed locals filled only from in-memory collections.",
